Haybarn-Wasm
============

Haybarn-Wasm is a derived distribution of DuckDB-Wasm, published by
Query Farm LLC under the same MIT License.

The original work is:

    DuckDB-Wasm
    Copyright 2018–2025 Stichting DuckDB Foundation
    Licensed under the MIT License
    https://github.com/duckdb/duckdb-wasm

This fork (Query-farm-haybarn/haybarn-wasm) adds Haybarn-specific changes
on top of that work, including:

  * npm package renames (@duckdb/* → @haybarn/*)
  * an engine submodule re-pointed at the Haybarn engine fork
    (Query-farm-haybarn/haybarn), which carries the Haybarn patch
    stack (extension repository URLs, trust root, branding strings)
  * documentation, NOTICE, and CI changes appropriate to the Haybarn
    distribution

